                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I finally got around to playing this game, I have no clue how long it has been in my library. While needing a break from what I was currently rotating, i jumped through my collections looking for something I had not tried in my library yet and landed on Splatter. \nI beat the main story and had a blast in survival for a little over 7 hours. I enjoyed this all the way through, it's old so it has it's flaws, but to take a quick break from other games and just kill zombies from a top down viewpoint , this didthe trick.",
